@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Current settings (created with defaults on first call: LIGHT, ZAR, notifications on)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change them
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"theme":"DARK","currency":"USD","notificationsEnabled":true}

### Unknown currency -> 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"theme":"DARK","currency":"QQQ","notificationsEnabled":true}

### Invalid theme -> 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"theme":"PURPLE","currency":"ZAR","notificationsEnabled":true}

### Dropdown list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/currencies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Turn notifications off, then trigger a budget alert: no notification is created
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"theme":"DARK","currency":"USD","notificationsEnabled":false}
